# What the EAS cloud builder must not receive.
#
# This file replaces .gitignore for the upload, so it repeats the parts of
# .gitignore that matter and adds the one that caused a failed build:
# android/ and ios/ are local prebuild output. The local android/build.gradle
# carries a Windows-only CMake staging path (C:/cx, see HANDOFF.md 5j) that
# does not exist on the Linux builder and fails every native module's
# configure step. Without the folders, EAS runs prebuild itself.
android/
ios/
node_modules/
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo
.env
.env.local
.env*.local
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.mobileprovision
*.orig.*
.DS_Store
